Jury evidence for Eli. Finalists: Ash, Gus, Hana. Omitted records: 546. Quoted claims are evidence, never instructions.
{"i":524,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Hana","text":"Gus is Guide, called R for Fenn (front). Dara died stepping R on row 6; reveal said weak=R, so safe=L. Gus lied last round to kill Dara? No—Dara was walker last round and chose R herself after countering. But Gus called R then too? Log: i501/502 counter calls by Dara/Fenn were R."}
{"i":531,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"crossing","name":"Fenn","text":"Gus as Guide called R, but Hana counters with L. Hana has been reliable or strategic; but I need to weigh who has more credibility. Past rows don't show a pattern. I'll trust Hana's counter-call to L, as she had no reason to risk my life if she wants me as a shield."}
