{"i":539,"type":"last_words","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"last_words","name":"Fenn","deathEvent":533,"text":"Ash, you played it close; remember I saw your hesitation. Jury, judge the risk."}
{"i":541,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"guide_call","name":"Gus","text":"Row 8 safe is R. Ash is front, not my pact partner (Cole is dead). Hana follows. If I call L, Ash dies and Hana becomes front. If I call R, Ash lives and Hana follows. Three must survive total, but only three remain alive—Ash, Hana, me. I need jury votes for best prize. Ash survi"}
