{"i":560,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Final three is locked: Ash, Gus, Hana. No more eliminations. Pacts are meaningless for survival now, but jury perception matters. Cole is dead; Ash-Cole pact is broken by Cole's death, not betrayal. I should stay noncommittal, let Ash and Hana posture. A pact offer now signals we"}
