{"i":589,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Hana","text":"I am locked in with both Ash and Gus, meaning we are effectively the final three. With the Crusher skipped, I must choose between maintaining these alliances or breaking one to position myself for a better jury ranking."}
