{"i":598,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Ash didn't accept my offer in round 1. Hana and I have a pact, and Ash-Hana have one too. If Ash accepts now, we have a three-way web. If not, I stick with Hana and hope Ash is the odd one out in the next hazard. I'll re-offer to pressure Ash, but won't break with Hana—she's my o"}
